{"id":"n57069-1-6","stage":2,"title":"문병 · 探病","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57069-1-6-1","ko":"몸은 좀 괜찮으세요?","zh":"身体还好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몸은","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"괜찮으세요?","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]}],"audio":"/audio/79f4c11c21e25cf9671f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57069-1-6-2","ko":"네. 이렇게 문병까지 와 주셔서 고마워요.","zh":"嗯，谢谢您还特意来探望我。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문병까지","meaning":"探病","explanation":"문병：探病；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"문병","audio":"/audio/534f328a52a07946926c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57069","senseId":"1","lemma":"문병","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"와","meaning":"来，来到","explanation":"오다：来，来到；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"1","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주셔서","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고마워요.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"534f328a52a07946","term":"문병","zh":"探病","audio":"/audio/534f328a52a07946926c.mp3","entryId":"57069","definition":"探望并安慰患病或受伤的人。","pronunciation":["문ː병"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"从别的地方移动到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ff577de4d3634dfb6ec5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.078,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57069","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":71,"sequenceScore":1.9047,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，谢谢您还特意来探望我。","你哥哥在哪儿？","身体还好吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，谢谢您还特意来探望我。","身体还好吗？","你哥哥在哪儿？"],"answer":0}]}
